---
import TextPage from '../components/TextPage.astro';

const title = 'Contact | Playzoni';
const description =
  'Contact Playzoni by email with questions, game problems or feedback. Send a message to hello@playzoni.com and we will read it.';
---
<TextPage title={title} description={description} canonicalPath="/contact" h1="Contact us">
  <p>
    Have a question, found a problem with a game, or want to tell us what you think of the site? Send us an email. We read
    every message.
  </p>

  <p>
    <a class="button" href="mailto:hello@playzoni.com">Email hello@playzoni.com</a>
  </p>

  <h2>Reporting a problem with a game</h2>
  <p>
    On every game page there is a flag button under the game. It opens an email that already has the name of the game in
    the subject, so we know which game you mean. Please tell us what device you used and what went wrong.
  </p>

  <h2>Game developers</h2>
  <p>If you make games and want to send one to us, read the page for <a href="/developers">game developers</a>.</p>
</TextPage>
